      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "[1434] There is an option to toggle remote player's camera shutters but it is still in \"World\" volume which is intentional. \n\nI feel that the toggle gives more reason for it to be back in \"UI\" volume since it's not something that is apart of the world the creator made and also fixes the issue where a user with \"World\" volume off (due to loud music or other things) cannot hear a remote player's camera shutter. The toggle is good for people who want to record events without the camera shutter sounds but also good for the general players who listen to their own music or don't like the world's music.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
