      "value": "I heard someone say, \"I sometimes mute the world volume when the world is too noisy. But if I do so, I can't hear the remote user's camera shutter and I can't be aware that I'm being filmed, so this change is not good for me.\"\n\nThis is not solved by the \"Suppress Remote-Player Camera Shutter Sound\" option added in 1434.",
